              "O(n) plus allocation"
            ],
            [
              "`Arc::clone`",
              "atomic increment"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`Rc`/`Arc`: 2 words overhead plus a count update per clone or drop",
            "`Arc` uses atomics and can contend across cores"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Borrow Here, Own There"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Borrow in hot loops — it is free",
            "Own in APIs that store the data",
            "Own when the value crosses a thread boundary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
