        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Fighting The Checker",
          "text": "Usually the data model is wrong. Reach for indices, arenas, an ECS, or interior mutability before contorting the code."
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Cloning is fine when the value is small or the code is cold",
